  "independent_scope": "Whole native selected-source content on both mattes, all9 selected poses plus adopted neutral at inherited maximum body reference 651.181912px across5both-matte pages, and all7 decoded discrete recipe rows actually viewed. Historical unselected sheet cells are not accepted by viewing their whole source. Physical UI zoom/density and real-time/interpolated/MP4 output not measured.",
  "observations": [
    "All nine full-canvas singleton originals actually inspected at native pixels on both light/dark mattes. Gray body with cream ear tufts/chest/belly, big oval dark nose, white-surrounded brown eyes, rosy cheeks, two paws and two feet are intact. Fresh think-v003 has clean background in both mattes; old alpha-cloud candidate is not selected or reapproved. No clipped tuft/ear/paw, duplicated limb, dirty paint slab or alpha field found.",
    "At inherited maximum body-reference651.1819116, all ten states remain crisp in eyes, nose, contours and feet. Quiet blink retains head/nose/torso and support placement closely. Connected rounded hands/gaze provide readable left/right and greeting; cheek think/aha and cheer are distinct.",
    "Small species gesture brings existing paws inward and then opens/settles them without an added prop or long limb. All seven static decoded sequence rows actually observed on both mattes, with coherent head/body scale and grounded support."
  ],
